   "text": "Five lanes keep the earlier idea:\nmechanical first, AI near the end,\npeople decide, governance records it.\nThe new parts sit inside those lanes.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Five lanes keep the earlier idea:\nmechanical first, AI near the end,\npeople decide, governance records it.\nThe new parts sit inside those lanes.",
