   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The branch and merge-request path (GitLab CI)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The branch and merge-request path (GitLab CI)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e00477",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 34,
   "y": 3254,
   "width": 435.6,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "e00441",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1393350509,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 148445350,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1  The package builder commits to a branch, never to main or a baseline.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1  The package builder commits to a branch, never to main or a baseline.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e00478",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 34,
   "y": 3298,
   "width": 635.25,
   "height": 27.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "e00441",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 438738743,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 514410764,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2  A CI job validates the package: schema, hash chain, policy, and a round trip (re-import the export and\ncompare).",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2  A CI job validates the package: schema, hash chain, policy, and a round trip (re-import the export and\ncompare).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e00479",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 34,
   "y": 3342,
   "width": 508.20000000000005,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "e00441",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1056167958,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 89103028,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3  A merge request opens with the change report attached. A named human approves it.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "3  A merge request opens with the change report attached. A named human approves it.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e00480",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 34,
   "y": 3386,
   "width": 568.7,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "e00441",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1849498223,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1040360382,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "4  Only after the merge does the source model change. The tool then takes a new snapshot (P2).",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "4  Only after the merge does the source model change. The tool then takes a new snapshot (P2).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
